---
layout: base.njk
title: Blogs | Pranav Joglekar
description: Pranav Joglekar's Blogs Page. Read Articles written by Pranav Joglekar here
permalink: /blogs/
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<ul class="items">
  {%- for post in posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a> <time class="note" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dayDate }}</time>
    <span class="meta">{{ post.description }}</span>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
